   Engine: DataFusion
   Execution Mode: Parallel
   Maximum Launched Workers: 2
   Parallel Runs: 1
   Maximum Worker Fragment Peak Memory Bytes: N
   Maximum Worker Participant Peak Memory Bytes: N
   Local Engine Peak Memory Bytes: 4096
   ->  Sort
         Sort Key: key ASC NULLS LAST
         ->  Aggregate
               Group Key: key
               Aggregates: STRING_AGG(label, ',' ORDER BY id ASC NULLS LAST), STRING_AGG(label, ',' ORDER BY value DESC NULLS LAST, id ASC NULLS LAST)
               ->  Table Scan on query_offload_parallel_left
                     Access Method: iceberg
                     Actual Input Batches: 33
                     Actual Input Rows: 33
                     Scan Tasks: 33
                     Data Files Selected: 33
                     Selected File Bytes: 53886
(20 rows)

